          A glass water filter pitcher is the right buy if you want filtered water to sit in glass instead of plastic, and you accept two things up front: the cartridge it passes through is almost always plastic, and the glass does nothing to make that filter better. Choose the certification first, then the glass. On that basis the LifeStraw Home glass pitcher is the one to buy for most people, and the Aarke Purifier is the one for anyone who cares more about plastic than paperwork.
