            <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#38BDF8] mb-3">THE RULE</p>
            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Glass decides where the water sits. The filter decides what is in it.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">Choose the certification first, then choose glass among the pitchers that meet it. A glass jug with a taste-only filter is a nicer jug, not cleaner water.</p>
          </div>
